# Faerie Fencing's additional -3/-3 asks whether you controlled a Faerie as you cast it (CR 601.2i), not as it resolves. Bot1
# controls no Faerie as it casts Faerie Fencing with X = 1 at Bot2's Concealing Curtains (0/4), then, holding priority, flashes
# in Faerie Mastermind, which resolves first: Bot1 controls a Faerie as Fencing resolves, but did not as it was cast. The
# Curtains get only -1/-1 and stay, -1/3 (with the bonus they would have 0 toughness and die).

